ll me the Indestructible Taimanin, though I probably still have some rough edges. Nice to meet you!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00035_1/uni00035_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"これから何をしましょう？　私に出来る事ならお手伝いしますよ","en":"What shall we do next? If there's anything I can help with, just let me know."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00035_1/uni00035_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"こら！　女性をからかうものじゃありません、怒りますよ！","en":"Hey! Don't you tease women, or I'll get angry!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00035_1/uni00035_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"最近周りの教官達から評判を聞きますよ。頑張ってるんですね","en":"I've been hearing good reports from the instructors lately. You're really giving it your all."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00035_1/uni00035_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"私あまり読書ってしないんです。今度オススメの本教えてくれませんか？","en":"I don't read much. Could you recommend a book for me sometime?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00035_1/uni00035_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"彼氏、ですか？　あ、いえ、私そういう事はよく分からなくて……","en":"A boyfriend? Ah, no—I'm not really sure about that sort of thing..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00035_1/uni00035_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"背中は私が金剛力でいつでも守っているわ。サポートは私に任せて！","en":"I'll always have your back with my indestructible power. Leave the support to me!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00035_1/uni00035_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"金遁の術は防御に優れた術です。だからこそ、私は仲間を守れる対魔忍になりたい","en":"The Golden Escape technique is great for defense. That's why I want to be a Taimanin who can protect my teammates."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00035_1/uni00035_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00035_1/uni00035_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label